                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div
                                class="p-6 md:p-8 md:pl-12 flex-grow flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center gap-6 md:gap-12"
                            >
                                <!-- Bullets Column -->
                                <div class="lg:w-[45%]">
                                    <ul class="space-y-3">
                                        <li
                                            class="flex items-start gap-4 text-secondary-slate text-[14px] font-body leading-relaxed"
                                        >
                                            <div
                                                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D1B27F] mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0"
                                            >
                                            </div>
                                            Lunges and barks at other dogs or strangers
                                        </li>
                                        <li
                                            class="flex items-start gap-4 text-secondary-slate text-[14px] font-body leading-relaxed"
                                        >
                                            <div
                                                class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#D1B27F] mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0"
                                            >
                                            </div>
